* SETDEF - CP/M 3 DEFAULT SETTINGS

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* SETDEF - CP/M 3 DEFAULT SETTINGS

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    SYSUTLS:SETDEF [search-drive-list] [options]

With no arguments, displays CP/M 3 default settings. Options control such
defaults as command search behavior, COM/SUB order, paging and display.

Z3PLUS also has its own Z-System PATH, so SETDEF and PATH are different
layers. Keep the supplied startup configuration unless deliberately
maintaining a private test installation.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
